{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2f27cb3c-6179-8cb6-8638-f5d54163207e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-05T11:04:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Adriana M. Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing Authority, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, thank you for taking my call. My name is Adriana Figueroa. I am calling because I would like to change my party affiliation, please. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. You're registered in Newport now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I am. On Narragansett Avenue, number 342. Thank you for asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:01:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. So you'd fill out a voter registration form with the new party marked on it. It's the same form you'd use for any change, name, address, party. You can pick one up here or print it, and then mail it in or bring it by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So it is a registration form, but I am already registered. I do not need to register again? Excuse me, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, you're not registering again. It's the same form, but you're just updating your record. You check the box that says it's a change and fill in the party you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. A box that says change. Thank you. And is there a deadline for this? I was told something about a deadline, but I do not remember if it was for this or for voting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question, those are two different things. There's a deadline before each election for changes, and it's generally a few weeks out. Is there a particular election you're thinking of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, the next one, I think. The primary? I am not sure which comes first. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I don't have the exact date for the next one in front of me. Let me check the calendar. Can you hold a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding. So the next election isn't right away, but the cutoff for party changes comes ahead of it, so you'd want to get the form in soon rather than wait. If you send it this month you're safe. I'd rather you not cut it close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This month. Yes. Thank you. So I should not wait until the week of the election. I apologize, I am a little confused, I thought I could do it at the polling place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's okay. Some changes can be handled at the polls, but it depends on the election, and it's easier to just do it ahead of time. Then you're all set."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, a little. Thank you. I am sorry to ask so many questions. I am in a hurry this morning because it is picture day at my son's school, and the shirt has to be ironed, and I left the iron on the table. Excuse me, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no problem, we'll get you out of here. Do you want me to mail the form to you at Narragansett Avenue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:04:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. That would be very kind. Thank you. And then I fill in the box that says change, and the party, and I mail it back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Sign it, date it, and mail it back or drop it off here at the office. It'll go out in today's mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Mr. Walter. Thank you for your patience. I think I understand, but if I do not, I will call again. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-05T11:04:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Have a good day, and good luck with the picture."
    }
  ],
